Z||000000||GTMike||08-31-2001||07:01 PM||||any one know what gm called the white they used on 87gt fieros.  alos where can i get a few cans of spray paint in this color?<P>thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||rogergarrison||08-31-2001||10:00 PM||||All you need is the WA #### from the label in the left front wheelwell inside the trunk. (RPO code) If you want spray cans just find that number on Duplicolor at the auto parts stores. Dont try to go by the name, they just make them up, the same color might have as many as five diff names on diff models.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Ronnie||08-31-2001||10:10 PM||||I'm sitting here looking in my Fiero Spotters Guide, and going by it , they didn't make a white 87 Fiero!! the white color is listed as 1984-86,8, no 87 listed. But the answer to your question is U40 number code for upper body color which was called "white".||||reg||6
Z||000003||GTMike||08-31-2001||11:35 PM||||wow i must have a really rare fiero.  u40 is what what i found on the fender well.  so go look for duplacolor u40?   i tryed that but they all hvae names like  ultra white 876 or blue white 453.   i didn't seen an y u40s||||reg||1
Z||000004||tgowens||09-01-2001||12:50 AM||||According to my information there were 2611 White Fieros made.......the color code for White is WA-8554<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocks_sig.jpg"> </A>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Pontiaddict||09-01-2001||12:54 AM||||Duplicolor code for the white is GM338 there is a 2 letter prefix to that number depending on the type of paint you are getting, spray can or touch up.<BR>||||reg||1
